    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33748" root="فره" body-key="f">
    
      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ يَسْتَفْرِهُ الأَفْرَاسَ</span></b>  means <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَسْتَكْرِمُهَا</span> [i. e. <i>He
seeks the horses,</i> or <i>mares, that are of generous
race</i>]: (aK, TA:) and the like is said in the A,
but with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الدَّوَابَّ</span> in the place of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الافراس</span>. (TA.)

